  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Integrating Climate Change Ada-UNDP-BGD-00115685</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Integrating Climate Change Adaptation into Sustainable Development Pathways of Bangladesh project will have the following outcomes: (1) Enhanced capacity with improved coordination mechanisms, databases and knowledge management systems at relevant ministries and line agencies to integrate climate change adaptation into national &amp; sub-national/local levels; (2) Adaptation options assessed and prioritized for all selected AEZs; (3) Adaptation options implemented in selected AEZs</narrative>
  </description>
